      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2891861066,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I believe my original rational was to have the taps registered near the protocols as I thought that would be the last thing to use them. However, comments in !22220 show that wslua needs to be initialized before taps can be registered.  So this just reorders the initialization list to have the taps initialized later.\nThis is one option for !22220 along with !22330.",
